    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person horror game. You are trapped in a hedge maze at night with a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, the creature is afraid of light and can be harmed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unluckily, there are only voice activated street lamps in the maze, and you have no other light sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you'll need to explore the labyrinth, collect keys, and find the way out\u2014all while using the voice-activated lamps as your only weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game captures your microphone audio volume, so shout loudly to control the lights and protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you don\u2019t have a microphone; there will be a control to make noise in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Playtime]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be a short horror experience lasting 20-40 minutes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person horror game. You are trapped in a hedge maze at night with a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, the creature is afraid of light and can be harmed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unluckily, there are only voice activated street lamps in the maze, and you have no other light sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you'll need to explore the labyrinth, collect keys, and find the way out\u2014all while using the voice-activated lamps as your only weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game captures your microphone audio volume, so shout loudly to control the lights and protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you don\u2019t have a microphone; there will be a control to make noise in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Playtime]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be a short horror experience lasting 20-40 minutes.</p>",
